      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm having a possibly related issue where the animation state machine is continually emitting a sound effect, created in an animation clip, even when the conditions for that transition aren't met.\nThe attached screenshot shows my FX object with the relevant layer selected.\nFlashlightToggle should be 0, as the object isn't visible and that's its default value, but anim_flashlight_turn_off and anim_flashlight_turn_on will still play the sound effect from the audio emitter when I do fingerpoint (GestureLeft 3).\nThis was working in build < 1004, is still broken (or worse?) in 1005, and I didn't modify my avatar or reupload it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
