      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I know this was closed, but I had forgotten about this canny until recently. After going reading through many peoples' descriptions of the problem, it sounds a lot like what I reported not too long ago. Especially since I am seeing people say it is a random chance whether or not it happens when you swap to the avatar. In particular, Blue Cat's video seems to show the exact issue in my canny.\nIn my canny post I also have the fix to the issue (at least the issue I found, which seems to be what some people are describing in these replies). Here it is, hopefully someone finds this helpful:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/avatar-30/p/1078-bug-removing-additive-layer-has-a-random-chance-of-breaking-gesture-based-s",
      "viewerReactions": null
